From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin Casey <4348807+justincasey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Spec decode: fresh random draws when block verification
 revisits a position

Block verification draws its acceptance uniform at (request seed, position).
A draft token past the accepted prefix is not committed, so the next round
drafts and verifies that position again, and drew the same uniform: the
rounds were correlated and sampled (temperature > 0) outputs were biased
(upstream measured P = 0.417 for an expected 0.5 with deterministic drafts,
the case of a greedy DSpark drafter). The acceptance uniform of draft step i
now uses spec_step_seed(seed, i), the step mixed into the seed's high bits;
step 0 keeps the plain seed. Standard verification is unchanged.

Probabilistic drafts cached for verification (gumbel_block_argmax with a
logits cache, the DFlash2 candidate walk) mix their cache column / step into
the seed the same way, so a revisited position also gets a fresh draft
draw. The vocabulary-parallel draft kernel (spec_decode/vocab_parallel.py,
not in upstream) mixes its cache column too, so it keeps drawing the
full-vocabulary path's tokens (test_vocab_parallel_draft_matches_full_vocab).

Greedy requests (temperature 0) are unchanged: their acceptance is an
argmax match that reads no uniform, and all-greedy batches take the greedy
verification path.

Port of vllm-project/vllm#61161 ("[Bugfix][Spec Decode] Avoid reusing random
draws across block verification rounds", fixes vllm-project/vllm#61114) by
DimensionSTP, merged 2026-10-15 as 9edcc7fa7ec858e13d4dc10ed968b741e2c95d6a.
Adapted to this tree: the watermark kernel here has no draft logits cache,
so upstream's watermark.py hunk and its test have nothing to apply to; this
tree has no LiLiCorr, so the candidate walk is DFlash2Speculator's; the
vocab-parallel hunk is ours. Tests: upstream's
test_multiround_rejection_sample_is_unbiased and
test_dspark_revisited_position_uses_step_seed (CUDA).

License: Apache-2.0 (dsv41-1017 recipe, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-4x-DGX-Spark).
